A||||5||sqoach||DOH! License expired!||||11||
Z||000000||sqoach||10-31-2001||01:48 PM||||Oh crap! I hope I don't get in trouble for this. My license expired in September. What do I do? How do I get it re-newed, or whatever? This is the first time I've done this, obviously. My b-day is in January, but I got a permit in September before my 16th b-day. So I guess this is why it expired then?<P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">              <BR>^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><LI>86 SC 2.5L 5spd</FONT>||||reg||11
Z||000001||Old Lar||10-31-2001||01:53 PM||||All licences are state granted and state laws differ.  You may need to take a new driver's test to get a new licence, or just fill out a bunch of paperwork.<P>Don't get caught driving without a licence, punishment may be no licence for a few years.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Ferrari_cdn||10-31-2001||03:02 PM||||Almost happened to me.  Weeks ago I got a new license in mail that I have to take in to pay for it.  I putit away under heaps of papers in my bedroom.  It was due the end of Oct.  Forgot about it ever since.  We are moving to an apartment so I had to clean up and put everything away in boxes and all.  Found the license and I was like Sh!t!  Went to the licensing place and got it renewed immediately.  If I haven't cleaned my room....<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ferrari_cdn" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ferrari_cdn.JPG">  </A>  <BR>AIM: CanadianFiero||||reg||11
Z||000003||Cheever3000||10-31-2001||04:21 PM||||Been too long since I lived in OK, but you probably have 60-90 days to renew without taking another test or anything.  And just in case they ask if you have driven since it expired, <B>just say no</B>.  Remember, the person at the DMV counter won't care personally, she (or he) is simply required to ask, but may also be required to impose a fine if the answer is Yes.  So make it easy on everybody and say no.  They probably won't ask.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Jake_Dragon||10-31-2001||05:28 PM||||Bring a friend with you because they will ask you how you got there. I always walk but thats just me.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000005||sqoach||11-01-2001||12:36 PM||||It was easier than I thought. Just went up to the counter and told them I need my license re-newed. And told them it expired last month. They said ok, and it'll be $19. And that's it! Just as simple as that. And they were nice and changed my next expiration date on my b-day, so I can remember it better.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||10
